# Environment Configuration Example for DEC IT PRO Network Tool
# (DECStudioHub/DEC-IT-PRO-Network-Tool)
#
# Note: The DEC IT PRO Network Tool is a client-side, browser-native site survey and network planner.
# All floor plan processing, hitmap rendering, cable length calculations, PDF generation,
# and project file persistence (Save / Save As / Load) operate securely within the user's browser.
#
# Optional custom base path for self-hosted subpath deployments (defaults to relative './' or '/DEC-IT-PRO-Network-Tool/' on GitHub Pages):
# BASE_PATH=/DEC-IT-PRO-Network-Tool/
